# Local development only: copy to .dev.vars (never commit it) and run `npm run dev`.
# In production set these in the Cloudflare dashboard as Secrets instead.

# ── Platform (required) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
ADMIN_API_KEY=choose-a-long-random-string-at-least-24-chars
ENCRYPTION_KEY=choose-another-long-random-string-at-least-32-chars

# ── Your own bot (same names as the original deployment) ──────────────────────
